d archive views. It serves as the source of\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/epic.md:17:turns or chunks did not replace the original process record.\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/epic.md:31:loss, and can be grouped into turns without mutating the archive. The first\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/epic.md:72:- Minimal derived-view records or responses over turns\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/epic.md:73:- Provenance from derived turns/views back to archive entries\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/epic.md:86:- Treating chunks, summaries, or turns as canonical process truth\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/epic.md:109:links needed for later turn derivation.\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/epic.md:155:  - Then: The platform returns them in a stable deterministic order\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/epic.md:220:4. User reloads or returns later\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/epic.md:240:  - When: User reloads or returns to the process later\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/epic.md:253:- **TC-3.3b: Missing process archive read returns not found**\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/epic.md:256:  - Then: The platform returns a process-not-found error\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/epic.md:268:return turns without making turns canonical truth.\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/epic.md:277:3. User or process reads the derived turns\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/epic.md:283:**AC-4.1:** The platform can derive turns from archived entries.\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/epic.md:286:  - Given: A process has archive entries that form one or more interaction turns\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--arch