/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/epic.md:338:  - Given: A process has derived turns\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/epic.md:339:  - When: User requests a derived view\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/epic.md:340:  - Then: The platform returns a derived view that identifies the turn boundary\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/epic.md:343:**AC-5.2:** Derived views identify structural boundaries for the turns they\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/epic.md:347:  - Given: A derived view is returned for a turn range\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/epic.md:352:**AC-5.3:** Derived views preserve provenance back to turns and archive entries.\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/epic.md:354:- **TC-5.3a: Derived view references source turns**\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/epic.md:355:  - Given: A derived view is returned\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/epic.md:357:  - Then: The view identifies the turn or turns it was derived from\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/epic.md:359:  - Given: A derived view references turns\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/epic.md:365:- **TC-5.4a: Archive remains after derived view creation**\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/epic.md:366:  - Given: A derived view has been created or refreshed\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/epic.md:377:  - Given: A derived view cannot fully resolve source turns or metadata\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/epic.md:379:  - Then: The platform returns a degraded derived-view state without hiding the canonical archive\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/epic.md:423:Archive and derived views must remain usable across reloads, process pauses,\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--arc