:[\"Story 1’s read paths are aligned to project-scoped artifact summaries and process-local current refs: `artifactSummarySchema` now exposes only `artifactId`, `displayName`, `currentVersionLabel`, and `updatedAt`, the project-shell UI no longer renders ownership copy, `setCurrentProcessMaterialRefs` updates per-process current refs after same-project validation, `MaterialsSectionReader` filters artifacts by those refs, and `DefaultArtifactReviewService` allows review when the process currently references the artifact while preserving earlier-version provenance via `producedByProcessId`.\",\"Legacy ownership residue still exists in the out-of-scope durable write path: `convex/artifacts.ts` keeps `artifacts.processId` in the table shape and still patches it during checkpoint writes. I did not treat that as a Story 1 failure because the story explicitly scopes revision/write-path realignment to later work, and none of the reviewed Story 1 read paths rely on that field anymore.\",\"Repo validation remains consistent with the onboarding baseline: `guard:no-test-changes` is a scaffolded skip inside `green-verify`, and `test:e2e` is still a scaffolded skip inside `verify-all`.\"]},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"result-envelope\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build-wt-1/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/01-project-artifact-association-without-process-ownership/006-verify.json\"}],\"startedAt\":\"2026-04-26T22:01:32.568Z\",\"finishedAt\":\"2026-04-26T22:12:51.874Z\"}\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/04-cross-process-package-alignment/007-verify.json:1:{\"command\":\"story-verify\",\"version\":1,\"status\":\"ok\",\"outcome\":\"pass\",\"result\":{\"resultId\":\"d521beac-60cb-4ba8-9e85-d0935d22defb\",\"role\":\"story_verifier\",\"provider\":\"codex\",\"model\":\"gpt-5.4\",\"sessionId\":\"019dcc1f-2c9c-7061-91b2-e07aacecba38\",\"continuation\":{\"provider\":\"codex\",\"sessionId\":\"019dcc1f-2c9c-7061-91b2-e07aacecba38\",\"storyId\":\"04-cross-process-package-alignment\"},\"mode\":\"followup\",\"story\":{\"id\":\"04-cross-process-package-alignment\",\"title\":\"Story 4: Cross-Process Package Alignment\"},\"artifactsRead\":[\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/stories/04-cross-process-package-alignment.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/tech-design-server.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/test-plan.md\",\"apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts\",\"convex/packageSnapshots.ts\",\"convex/processPackageContexts.ts\",\"convex/processPackageContextMembers.ts\"],\"reviewScopeSummary\":\"Follow-up verification focused on closing SV-04-001. I re-read the Story 4 AC-4.2 requirement and the server design note for package-context ownership, inspected the touched Convex package-context files plus their PlatformStore caller, and reran verification sequentially to confirm the access-control fix landed without introducing touched-surface regressions.\",\"priorFindingStatuses\":[{\"id\":\"SV-04-001\",\"status\":\"resolved\",\"rationale\":\"Resolved by code change: `convex/processPackageContexts.ts` now exposes `getCurrentProcessPackageContext` via `internalQuery` and `clearCurrentProcessPackageContext` / `upsertCurrentProcessPackageContext` via `internalMutation`, and `convex/processPackageContextMembers.ts` now exposes member reads via `internalQuery`. That closes the public unauthenticated Convex surface that previously bypassed the Fastify control-plane boundary for AC-4.2. Sequential reruns of `green-verify` and `verify-all` passed after the fix.\"}],\"newFindings\":[],\"openFindings\":[],\"requirementCoverage\":{\"verified\":[\"AC-4.1\",\"AC-4.2\",\"AC-4.3\",\"AC-4.4\"],\"unverified\":[]},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm exec vitest run tests/service/server/process-live-updates.test.ts --environment node\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}],\"mockOrShimAuditFindings\":[\"No production-path mocks, shims, or fake adapters were introduced in the package-context access-control fix; the touched change stayed within real Convex/Fastify paths.\"],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"pass\",\"recommendedFixScope\":\"quick-fix\",\"openQuestions\":[],\"additionalObservations\":[\"`verify-all` still ends with the repo's scaffold-only `test:e2e` step, so executable end-to-end evidence for this story remains service, client, and integration coverage rather than a live browser suite.\"]},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"result-envelope\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build-wt-1/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/04-cross-process-package-alignment/007-verify.json\"}],\"startedAt\":\"2026-04-26T23:40:25.767Z\",\"finishedAt\":\"2026-04-26T23:43:14.892Z\"}\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/04-cross-process-package-alignment/006-verify.json:1:{\"command\":\"story-verify\",\"version\":1,\"status\":\"ok\",\"outcome\":\"revise\",\"result\":{\"resultId\":\"362abf87-6055-4eba-8a8b-422d47cfcef4\",\"role\":\"story_verifier\",\"provider\":\"codex\",\"model\":\"gpt-5.4\",\"sessionId\":\"019dcc1f-2c9c-7061-91b2-e07aacecba38\",\"continuation\":{\"provider\":\"codex\",\"sessionId\":\"019dcc1f-2c9c-7061-91b2-e07aacecba38\",\"storyId\":\"04-cross-process-package-alignment\"},\"mode\":\"initial\",\"story\":{\"id\":\"04-cross-process-package-alignment\",\"title\":\"Story 4: Cross-Process Package Alignment\"},\"artifactsRead\":[\"convex/_generated/ai/guidelines.md\",\"docs/onboarding/current-state-index.md\",\"docs/onboarding/current-state-process-work-surface.md\",\"docs/onboarding/current-state-tech-design.md\",\"docs/onboarding/current-state-code-map.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/stories/04-cross-process-package-alignment.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/tech-design.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/tech-design-client.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/tech-design-server.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/test-plan.md\",\"apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/review/artifact-review.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/review/package-review.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/review/export.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/review/review-workspace.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/routes/review.ts\",\"convex/schema.ts\",\"convex/packageSnapshots.ts\",\"convex/processPackageContexts.ts\",\"convex/processPackageContextMembers.ts\",\"convex/packageSnapshots.test.ts\",\"convex/processPackageContexts.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/package-review-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/review-export-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/client/package-member-nav.test.ts\",\"tests/integration/review-workspace.test.ts\"],\"reviewScopeSummary\":\"Verified Story 4 against AC-4.1 through AC-4.4 by reading the story, full tech-design set, test plan, onboarding baseline, and the touched durable-state/store/review/export code paths. I focused on package publication eligibility, current package-context durability and reopen seeding, pinned-version package review/export behavior, and the supporting regression suite plus Story/Epic gates.\",\"priorFindingStatuses\":[],\"newFindings\":[{\"id\":\"SV-04-001\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"Current package-context reads and writes are exposed as unauthenticated public Convex functions\",\"evidence\":\"`convex/processPackageContexts.ts` registers `getCurrentProcessPackageContext` as a public `query` and `clearCurrentProcessPackageContext` / `upsertCurrentProcessPackageContext` as public `mutation` handlers, and `convex/processPackageContextMembers.ts` exposes member enumeration as a public `query`; none of those handlers authenticate callers or validate a service key. `apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts` consumes them as server-side store primitives, while the comparable package snapshot publish/read path stays internal-only in `convex/packageSnapshots.ts`. As shipped, anyone who can reach the Convex deployment can read or overwrite another process's mutable package-building context, which breaks the story's process-scoped context guarantee and bypasses the Fastify control-plane boundary.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"convex/processPackageContexts.ts\",\"convex/processPackageContextMembers.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-4.2\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"quick-fix\",\"blocking\":true}],\"openFindings\":[{\"id\":\"SV-04-001\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"Current package-context reads and writes are exposed as unauthenticated public Convex functions\",\"evidence\":\"`convex/processPackageContexts.ts` registers `getCurrentProcessPackageContext` as a public `query` and `clearCurrentProcessPackageContext` / `upsertCurrentProcessPackageContext` as public `mutation` handlers, and `convex/processPackageContextMembers.ts` exposes member enumeration as a public `query`; none of those handlers authenticate callers or validate a service key. `apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts` consumes them as server-side store primitives, while the comparable package snapshot publish/read path stays internal-only in `convex/packageSnapshots.ts`. As shipped, anyone who can reach the Convex deployment can read or overwrite another process's mutable package-building context, which breaks the story's process-scoped context guarantee and bypasses the Fastify control-plane boundary.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"convex/processPackageContexts.ts\",\"convex/processPackageContextMembers.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-4.2\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"quick-fix\",\"blocking\":true}],\"requirementCoverage\":{\"verified\":[\"AC-4.1\",\"AC-4.3\",\"AC-4.4\"],\"unverified\":[\"AC-4.2\"]},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm exec vitest run convex/packageSnapshots.test.ts convex/processPackageContexts.test.ts tests/service/server/package-review-api.test.ts tests/service/server/review-export-api.test.ts tests/integration/review-workspace.test.ts --environment node\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}],\"mockOrShimAuditFindings\":[\"No production-path mocks, shims, or fake adapters were introduced in the Story 4 publish/review/export/package-context seams; the in-memory store and fake Convex contexts remain test-only evidence surfaces.\"],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"revise\",\"recommendedFixScope\":\"quick-fix\",\"openQuestions\":[],\"additionalObservations\":[\"`verify-all` passed, but the repo's `test:e2e` lane is still scaffold-only and prints a skip message, so integration coverage is the deepest executable end-to-end evidence for this story.\",\"Several Story 4 assertions are traceable by behavior rather than by test title because some package review/export test names still carry stale TC labels from adjacent chunks.\"]},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"result-envelope\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build-wt-1/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/04-cross-process-package-alignment/006-verify.json\"}],\"startedAt\":\"2026-04-26T23:28:08.202Z\",\"finishedAt\":\"2026-04-26T23:35:12.459Z\"}\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/0