rning a bare `SourceAttachmentSummary`. I did not treat that as blocking.\",\"`verify-all` passed, but the repo-baseline `test:e2e` script is still a scaffold that prints a skip message by design.\",\"AGENTS.md points to `docs/onboarding/current-state-*` files, but those onboarding files are not present in this checkout; verification proceeded from the story, tech design, test plan, code, and tests.\"]},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"result-envelope\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/artifacts/02-manage-purpose-access-mode-and-target-ref/005-verify.json\"}],\"startedAt\":\"2026-05-04T19:09:29.723Z\",\"finishedAt\":\"2026-05-04T19:15:14.974Z\"}\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/018-verify.json:1:{\"command\":\"story-verify\",\"version\":1,\"status\":\"ok\",\"outcome\":\"pass\",\"result\":{\"resultId\":\"0311ad26-262f-4927-8923-fade902c2b0d\",\"role\":\"story_verifier\",\"provider\":\"codex\",\"model\":\"gpt-5.4\",\"sessionId\":\"019df617-f545-7c12-973a-19e600231531\",\"continuation\":{\"provider\":\"codex\",\"sessionId\":\"019df617-f545-7c12-973a-19e600231531\",\"storyId\":\"01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence\"},\"mode\":\"followup\",\"story\":{\"id\":\"01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence\",\"title\":\"Story 1: Canonical Archive Entry Persistence\"},\"artifactsRead\":[\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md\",\"convex/archiveEntries.ts\",\"convex/archiveEntries.test.ts\"],\"reviewScopeSummary\":\"Follow-up convergence after continuation 015: verified that the Story 1 primitive exports were restored in `convex/archiveEntries.ts`, checked that the narrowed primitive-