vex/archiveEntries.test.ts` still imports those symbols at `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts:1-3`, so the targeted Story 1 test now fails immediately with `_handler` undefined, and `corepack pnpm run green-verify` fails in typecheck with `TS2305: Module './archiveEntries.js' has no exported member 'appendArchiveEntry'` and `listArchiveEntries`. A repo search over `convex` and `apps/platform` found no replacement mutation/query export for these primitive functions. This removes the executable Story 1 persistence surface and breaks the configured story gate.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"convex/archiveEntries.ts\",\"convex/archiveEntries.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-1.1\",\"TC-1.1a\",\"TC-1.1b\",\"TC-1.1c\",\"AC-1.2\",\"TC-1.2a\",\"TC-1.2b\",\"AC-1.3\",\"TC-1.3a\",\"TC-1.3b\",\"AC-1.4\",\"TC-1.4a\",\"TC-1.4b\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"blocking\":true}],\"openFindings\":[{\"id\":\"S1-F3\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"The current archiveEntries module no longer exports the Story 1 append/read primitive, and the story gate now fails\",\"evidence\":\"`convex/archiveEntries.ts` currently contains only validators and `archiveEntriesTableFields` (`convex/archiveEntries.ts:1-45`); it does not export `appendArchiveEntry` or `listArchiveEntries`. `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts` still imports those symbols at `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts:1-3`, so the targeted Story 1 test now fails immediately with `_handler` undefined, and `corepack pnpm run green-verify` fails in typecheck with `TS2305: Module './archiveEntries.js' has no exported member 'appendArchiveEntry'` and `listArchiveEntries`. A repo search over `convex` and `apps/platform` found no replacement mutation/query export for these primitive functions. This removes the executable Story 1 persistence surface and breaks the configured story gate.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"convex/archiveEntries.ts\",\"convex/archiveEntries.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-1.1\",\"TC-1.1a\",\"TC-1.1b\",\"TC-1.