sed on convergence against SV-05-01 across the new shared active-source resolver, start/resume hydration-plan creation, rehydrate/rebuild planning, checkpoint source selection, and the directly touched regression tests.\",\"priorFindingStatuses\":[{\"id\":\"SV-05-01\",\"status\":\"resolved\",\"rationale\":\"The touched runtime paths now reuse a shared active-source resolver that excludes detached rows and preserves process-scope shadowing (`apps/platform/server/services/processes/active-process-sources.ts:13-63`). That resolver is applied in process materials reads (`.../materials-section.reader.ts:82-117`), future hydration-plan creation for start/resume (`.../process-start.service.ts:57-81`, `.../process-resume.service.ts:58-82`), rehydrate/rebuild planning (`.../process-environment.service.ts:1269-1290`), and checkpoint source selection (`.../process-environment.service.ts:747-784`). The expanded Story 5 runtime test now proves detach leaves the already-persisted hydrated copy plan untouched while future rehydrate/rebuild plans drop the detached source and checkpoint writes are blocked (`tests/service/server/process-execution-orchestrator.test.ts:857-1063`). The focused follow-up test run and `corepack pnpm run green-verify` both passed.\"}],\"newFindings\":[],\"openFindings\":[],\"requirementCoverage\":{\"verified\":[\"AC-5.1\",\"TC-5.1a\",\"TC-5.1b\",\"TC-5.1c\",\"AC-5.2\",\"TC-5.2a\",\"AC-5.3\",\"TC-5.3a\"],\"unverified\":[]},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm exec vitest run tests/service/server/process-execution-orchestrator.test.ts tests/service/server/process-actions-api.test.ts tests/service/server/process-live-updates.test.ts tests/service/server/source-management-api.test.ts tests/service/client/source-management-ui.test.ts convex/sourceAttachments.test.ts convex/sourceProvenance.test.ts\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"not-run\"