ated contract tests verify the expanded source schemas and reject missing Epic 6 identity/freshness fields.\",\"S0-GATE-1 Configured story gate passed.\",\"S0-GATE-2 Configured epic gate passed.\"],\"unverified\":[]},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}],\"productionPathFindings\":[],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"pass\",\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"openQuestions\":[],\"additionalObservations\":[\"AGENTS.md references docs/onboarding/current-state-* files, but those onboarding docs are not present in this checkout; verification relied on the story, tech design, test plan, and inspected code/tests.\",\"The repo's verify-all script passed end-to-end; its final e2e phase currently reports a scaffold skip message rather than running a real suite, and that is the present script behavior rather than a Story 0 regression.\"]},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"result-envelope\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/artifacts/00-foundation/005-verify.json\"}],\"startedAt\":\"2026-05-04T18:02:08.777Z\",\"finishedAt\":\"2026-05-04T18:07:33.893Z\"}\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive/008-verify.json:1:{\"command\":\"story-verify\",\"version\":1,\"status\":\"ok\",\"outcome\":\"revise\",\"result\":{\"resultId\":\"38578435-800e-4b3f-a5e6-eee3bcf3d54e\",\"role\":\"story_verifier\",\"provider\":\"codex\",\"model\":\"gpt-5.4\",\"sessionId\":\"019df65d-ae2d-76f2-b10e-29bf2d50250d\",\"continuation\":{\"provider\":\"codex\",\"sessionId\":\"019df65d-ae2d-76f2-b10e-29bf2d50250d\",\"storyId\":\"02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive\"},\"mode\":\"initial\",\"story\":{\"id\":\"02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive\",\"title\":\"Story 2: Finalization Boundary Between Live State and Archive\"},\"artifactsRead\":[\"convex/_generated/ai/guidelines.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md\",\"apps/platform/server/services/archive/archive-finalization.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/archive/process-history-compat.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/processes/process-response.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/processes/environment/process-environment.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/processes/live/process-live-normalizer.ts\",\"apps/platform/client/app/process-live.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/processes/environment/provider-adapter.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/processes/environment/script-execution.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/processes/environment/local-provider-adapter.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/processes/environment/daytona-provider-adapter.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts\",\"tests/service/server/archive-finalization.test.ts\",\"tests/service/client/archive-section.test.ts\",\"tests/service/client/process-live.test.ts\"],\"reviewScopeSummary\":\"Reviewed Story 2 against the story, full tech design, and test plan; inspected the new archive finalization service plus response/environment hooks and live-separation surfaces; ran focused story tests and the story gate; and reproduced a compatibility-bridge edge case in the real in-memory production path.\",\"priorFindingStatuses\":[],\"newFindings\":[{\"id\":\"story2-user-message-bridge-key-mismatch\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"Bridge-first user responses still create duplicate canonical archive entries\",\"evidence\":\"`ProcessHistoryCompatService` derives bridged `user_message` keys from `historyItemId` (`apps/platform/server/services/archive/process-history-compat.service.ts:61-68`), while `ProcessResponseService` archives the same accepted response under `response:${clientRequestId}` (`apps/platform/server/services/processes/process-response.service.ts:153-168`). `ArchiveFinalizationService` only short-circuits when an existing row with the same `sourceObjectId` is already present (`apps/platform/server/services/archive/archive-finalization.service.ts:70-79`), so the opposite order still duplicates. I reproduced this with `corepack pnpm exec tsx` by calling `submitProcessResponse()` -> `appendFromProcessHistoryItem()` -> `respond()`; the archive then contained two `user_message` rows for the same `sourceObjectId`: `response:process-archive-finalization:history-response-1` and `response:req-archive-4`.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"apps/platform/server/services/archive/process-history-compat.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/archive/archive-finalization.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/processes/process-response.service.ts\",\"tests/service/server/archive-finalization.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-2.3\",\"TC-2.3b\",\"DoD-compatibility-mapping\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"quick-fix\",\"blocking\":true},{\"id\":\"story2-green-verify-format-failure\",\"severity\":\"minor\",\"title\":\"Story gate currently fails at format check\",\"evidence\":\"`corepack pnpm run green-verify` exited 1 in `format:check` because Biome would reformat the constructor type wrapping in `apps/platform/server/services/archive/archive-finalization.service.ts:15-17`. The story gate therefore does not pass in the current workspace.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"apps/platform/server/services/archive/archive-finalization.service.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"StoryGate\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"quick-fix\",\"blocking\":true},{\"id\":\"story2-live-archive-separation-proof-missing\",\"severity\":\"minor\",\"title\":\"Required live/archive separation test coverage is still missing\",\"evidence\":\"Story 2's Definition of Done and test plan require proof that live history upserts keep updating current state without creating archive rows. Repo search found no archive assertions in the designated live-surface tests: `rg -n \\\"archive|appendArchive|ArchiveFinalization\\\" tests/service/client/process-live.test.ts tests/service/server/process-live-updates.test.ts apps/platform/server/services/processes/live/process-live-normalizer.ts apps/platform/client/app/process-live.ts` returned no matches, and the added focused tests only cover `tests/service/server/archive-finalization.test.ts` plus archive seed mapping.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"tests/service/client/process-live.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/process-live-updates.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"DoD-live-archive-separation\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"quick-fix\",\"blocking\":true}],\"openFindings\":[{\"id\":\"story2-user-message-bridge-key-mismatch\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"Bridge-first user responses still create duplicate canonical archive entries\",\"evidence\":\"`ProcessHistoryCompatService` derives bridged `user_message` keys from `historyItemId` (`apps/platform/server/services/archive/process-history-compat.service.ts:61-68`), while `ProcessResponseService` archives the same accepted response under `response:${clientRequestId}` (`apps/platform/server/services/processes/process-response.service.ts:153-168`). `ArchiveFinalizationService` only short-circuits when an existing row with the same `sourceObjectId` is already present (`apps/platform/server/services/archive/archive-finalization.service.ts:70-79`), so the opposite order still duplicates. I reproduced this with `corepack pnpm exec tsx` by calling `submitProcessResponse()` -> `appendFromProcessHistoryItem()` -> `respond()`; the archive then contained two `user_message` rows for the same `sourceObjectId`: `response:process-archive-finalization:history-response-1` and `response:req-archive-4`.\",\"affectedFiles\":[